Package: cinminai-whisper
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Cin-MinAI <https://github.com/Cin-MinAI/Cin-MinAI>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libstdc++6, libgcc-s1, libgomp1, ffmpeg
Description: whisper.cpp for the Cin-MinAI assistant (speech in videos)
 The pinned whisper.cpp release (whisper-cli) that turns the speech in a video
 into text, so the assistant can summarize the video from what is said as well
 as what is shown. It runs on the processor; ffmpeg takes the sound and the key
 pictures out of the video. The speech model itself is downloaded only when the
 person asks for a video summary and agrees. Nothing here sends anything. How it
 was built: /usr/share/doc/cinminai-whisper/BUILDINFO.
